项目的布置；\n5、负责建立智能泊车产品开发流程及相关需求维护；\n6、负责自动泊车、全景系统整体方案设计及优化，输出系统功能定义和关联系统需求；\n7、负责智能泊车影像相关产品的测试规范建立，标定匹配和测试评价。\n注：该岗位需负责以上一项或几项工作内容。","Require":"1.学历要求：全日制大学本科及以上学历。\n2.专业要求：机械工程、车辆工程、电气及自动化、通信工程等专业优先。\n3.工作经历：4年及以上工作经验。有主机厂或零部件供应商泊车、影像系统2年以上工作经验优先。熟悉摄像头制造工艺者优先\n4.专业技能：\n4.1熟悉CAD、CATIA，OFFICE办公软件等。\n4.2对整车原理认识较深刻（底盘、电器、动力系统）。\n4.3熟悉汽车网络（CAN/LIN）网络通信原理，对于智能驾驶产品开发流程具有较强的理解，具备图像、泊车影像测试评价能力。\n4.4熟练使用canoe/canspy/周立功等工具。\n5.语言要求：本科生获得CET四级，硕士生获得CET六级，具有良好的英语听说读写能力，能阅读汽车相关资料。\n6.综合素质：有较强的语言表达及团队协作能力，思想素质过硬，责任感强，具有较强奉献精神，业务技能、管理意识和协调能力强，并善于运用新的工作方法解决问题，能吃苦耐劳。\n7.其他：具有C1驾照且有实际驾驶经验1年以上者优先考虑。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-03-19T18:53:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"9c3c173d-57f8-4ef2-ac0c-ca0de61042a8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":150858425,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"应用软件优化与集成领域工程师(J21819)","OrgId":3387681,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责新汽车